{"version":1,"key":"card:760","content":{"id":760,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在打开浏览器网络面板的时候，会发现浏览器发送的请求始终携带三个请求头，比如下面是一个向服务端请求数据时携带的请求头","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"25185bc7-c8de-4ba1-a1af-1a2838695c5b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin\nSec-Fetch-Mode: cors\nSec-Fetch-Dest: empty","collabId":"7205a4fb-ef4a-48e1-9f06-192fdbf44dcd","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"d29f1b9d-357b-40a7-9e8a-eb4706bf8e2c","language":"HTTP","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c71859de-2a61-4c1e-8ad6-af81052c0d73"},{"children":[{"text":"这三个请求头被称为 Fetch Metadata Request Header，它们的目的是给服务器提供请求的上下文，比如这个请求是通过 JavaScript 发起的，还是页面导航跳转的，请求的资源类型是什么，是否跨站，是否由用户主动发起。服务器知道了这些信息，就可以用来有效防御跨站攻击。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d7c858dd-75fe-435f-93d2-8ad240e4302f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"实际上 Fetch Metadata 规范一共定义了四个请求头，除了上面出现的三个，还有一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Sec-Fetch-User","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，它只在特定场景下才会出现。下面逐一来看：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2b728d29-1ab5-4cb6-b532-4d29c1821384","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"Sec-Fetch-Site","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：表示请求来源的 origin 与目标资源的 origin 之间的关系，有四种取值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fe95c5fe-d92c-4af1-8943-fc8c1d6ba33e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"same-origin","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：完全相同的 origin，即协议、域名和端口都相同","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cc5b073a-398b-4d9b-80c6-e96ae14c7541","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8b85ed4e-e8f5-4fca-a875-7149b7f6e11e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"same-site","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：协议和可注册域名相同（eTLD+1 相同）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c262bb8f-539e-4ea6-bae9-0624a5bf8832","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"https://www.example.com\nhttps://api.example.com\nhttps://static.example.com","collabId":"cd4a6337-7268-459f-947e-7a3a2308f6ff","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"556b491d-40d1-49e7-994e-7a6d7c10ad92","language":"HTTP","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b7390305-e448-47d8-9104-59c02e5c1c3a"},{"children":[{"text":"这三个地址就是 same-site 的，因为它们协议相同，都是 https，它们的 eTLD+1 都是 example.com，所以是 same-site，但是子域名不同，所以不是 same-origin","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7b9943e2-42cb-4eb7-81c7-25a47bc60c90","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c074f55d-2124-4b8b-b272-060c3727b0e0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"cross-site","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：不是同一个站点，比如 https://a.com 与 https://b.com","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"45cfb7b6-e75f-4b80-ac3b-55e354e911f8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4cfa9375-2644-4086-9d2b-1f90b3dbe52c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"none","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：请求不是从页面中发起的，比如用户在地址栏直接输入地址、从书签打开网页、或者拖拽链接打开页面","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e2664fc9-faa8-453c-8ec7-8f30b75d7150","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"495ea734-4695-43ee-b488-3178e6ac87e0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"1b3a6ce6-14fb-4e7f-9781-6af14258c023","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"84da991e-c996-45e4-9942-d5adf32a5244","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"Sec-Fetch-Mode","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：表示请求的模式，即请求是以什么方式发出的，有五种取值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e5f38671-20fb-4f27-bb33-2544147edcc6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"navigate","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：页面导航，包括地址栏输入、点击链接、iframe 导航、表单提交跳转","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1bb3f23d-1685-4a0a-adae-0884f784ebc5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9779db97-c52d-4401-b083-ae4f2b247e6f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"cors","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：通过 fetch/XHR 发起的网络请求，虽然模式叫 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cors","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，但不代表一定是跨域请求，是否跨域要看 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Sec-Fetch-Site","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b8089690-d3ff-4ec9-8982-9f65691922bb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"376ce43d-c4b0-4078-b82f-fd7e8ec1238e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"no-cors","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<script>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\">","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 等传统标签加载资源时使用该模式","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"09440cd9-e134-48f3-a2db-8724a2bb6fb7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6d92802d-4d28-4911-aef7-2a7ece98e532","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"same-origin","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"new Worker()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 加载脚本时，或通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fetch","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 显式指定 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"mode: 'same-origin'","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 时","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"827ac3c8-b3b7-4252-a923-b3bab21c74a7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"943083b6-19cb-477b-996f-db88bbe03070","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"websocket","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"new WebSocket()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 建立连接时","type":"formatted"}]